<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Algorithm</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Desperate Times, Desperate Pleasures</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5D79BSl3H0E5sEoZDjEQqB</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.440" end="00:36.440">Baby blue they paid you to take my youth &amp; use it up.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.010" end="00:48.870">They don’t want a dilettante from up north in their club.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.870" end="00:55.980">But the truth is I was always useless, made excuses (I still do).</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.980" end="01:03.210">If the dream is fading, you can always change it.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.210" end="01:07.770">I was by the wayside, never seeing daylight.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.770" end="01:12.450">Do whatever they like, just tell me what you people want.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.450" end="01:17.730">Tryna live a new life, do whatever you like.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.730" end="01:25.730">Wearing somebody else’s clothes.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.620" end="01:39.620">Cause the summer, it ain’t gonna last forever.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.590" end="01:53.160">You gotta wake up.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.160" end="02:00.330">But the truth is I was always useless, made excuses (I still do)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.330" end="02:07.590">If the dream is fading, you can always change it.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.590" end="02:12.120">I was by the wayside, never seeing daylight.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.120" end="02:16.800">Do whatever they like, just tell me what you people want.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.800" end="02:22.080">Tryna live a new life, do whatever you like.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.080" end="02:23.580">Wearing somebody else’s clothes.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.740" end="02:30.740">Someone else’s clothes, oh feet don’t fail me now.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.790" end="02:46.790">I wish I could let go.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.520" end="03:07.290">I was by the wayside, never seeing daylight.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.290" end="03:14.700">Do whatever they like, just tell me what you people want.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.700" end="03:18.990">Tryna live a new life, do whatever you like.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.990" end="03:22.990">Wearing somebody else’s clothes.</p></div></body></tt>